# Kept out of the image: in production every service that runs this image (api, worker,
# styles-worker, converter, beat) mounts the media_data volume over /app/media, so a copy baked
# into the image is never seen. It was 533 MB of the repo's 3D model library, and re-pulling it
# made every backend deploy take 13-25 minutes instead of 2-3 (2026-11-14).
media/
